{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_011CeuoExiSL65ZcvoHGEyN9","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**Repository findings:**\n- `ShipmentController.kt:21` — existing POST/GET endpoints\n- `Shipment.kt:9-14` — entity with status field\n- `ShipmentStatus.kt:23-27` — enum with CREATED, CONFIRMED, CANCELLED\n- `ShipmentRepository.kt:11-27` — in-memory repository with save, findById, existsById\n- `ApiExceptions.kt:18-24` — ConflictException and ResourceNotFoundException classes\n- `ApiError.kt:31-37` — ErrorCode enum (ORDER_NOT_FOUND, ORDER_ALREADY_EXISTS, SHIPMENT_NOT_FOUND, SHIPMENT_ALREADY_EXISTS, VALIDATION_FAILED)\n- `GlobalExceptionHandler.kt:14-29` — centralized error handler for ApiException types\n\n**Conventions this repository has:**\n1. Errors thrown as exceptions (ConflictException for 409, ResourceNotFoundException for 404)\n2. All exceptions use ErrorCode enum for machine-readable error identification\n3. GlobalExceptionHandler converts exceptions to consistent ApiError envelope\n4. POST endpoints modifying existing resources return 200 OK with the resource\n5. Repository methods: save(), findById(), existsById(), findAll()\n6. Tests use MockMvc with assertions on both status and response body (jsonPath)\n\n**Affected files:**\n1. `ShipmentController.kt` — add `confirm` endpoint to handle POST /shipments/{shipmentId}/confirm\n2. `ApiError.kt` — add ErrorCode for shipment invalid state (required for 409 CANCELLED rejection)\n3. `ShipmentControllerTest.kt` — add tests for all four cases (created→confirmed, retry idempotency, cancelled rejection, not found rejection)\n\n**Risks:**\n- Breaking existing tests if controller is modified incorrectly\n- Idempotency not implemented correctly (CONFIRMED retry must not fail)\n- Missing the global exception handling integration\n- ErrorCode inconsistency with existing patterns\n\n**Open questions:**\n- What ErrorCode to use when rejecting CANCELLED shipment? The enum currently has SHIPMENT_NOT_FOUND and SHIPMENT_ALREADY_EXISTS, but nothing for \"invalid state for operation\". I'll add SHIPMENT_INVALID_STATE to follow the domain-specific naming pattern.\n\n---\n\n<<PHASE:DESIGN>>\n\n**Proposed change, file by file:**\n\n1. **ApiError.kt** — Add one new ErrorCode enum value:\n   - `SHIPMENT_INVALID_STATE` — used when attempting to confirm a cancelled shipment\n\n2. **ShipmentController.kt** — Add new method `confirm`:\n   ```\n   POST /shipments/{shipmentId}/confirm\n   - Fetch shipment by ID → throw ResourceNotFoundException if null (404)\n   - If status is CANCELLED → throw ConflictException with SHIPMENT_INVALID_STATE (409)\n   - If status is CREATED → update to CONFIRMED, save, return with 200 OK\n   - If status is CONFIRMED → no-op, return unchanged with 200 OK\n   - Return ResponseEntity.ok(updatedOrExistingShipment)\n   ```\n\n3. **ShipmentControllerTest.kt** — Add four test cases:\n   - `confirms a created shipment` → POST to /shipments/{id}/confirm on CREATED shipment → expect 200 OK with status CONFIRMED\n   - `confirms an already confirmed shipment is idempotent` → POST twice to same CONFIRMED shipment → expect 200 OK both times, shipment unchanged\n   - `rejects confirming a cancelled shipment` → POST to /shipments/{id}/confirm on manually-set CANCELLED shipment → expect 409 Conflict with error code SHIPMENT_INVALID_STATE\n   - `rejects confirming a nonexistent shipment` → POST to /shipments/{id}/confirm with fake id → expect 404 Not Found with error code SHIPMENT_NOT_FOUND\n\n**Alternative considered and rejected:**\n- *Could use VALIDATION_FAILED (400) instead of adding a new ErrorCode* — Rejected because HTTP 409 Conflict is the semantic standard for \"valid request but violates resource state\", and a machine-readable error code helps clients distinguish this from input validation errors.\n- *Could add confirm logic to service layer* — Rejected because the existing architecture puts business logic directly in controllers (no service layer exists), and ShipmentController already handles all transitions inline.\n\n**Data and error flow:**\n\n| Case | Read | Modify | Write | Return | Status |\n|------|------|--------|-------|--------|--------|\n| CREATED → CONFIRMED | findById | status = CONFIRMED | save | updated shipment | 200 OK |\n| CONFIRMED → CONFIRMED | findById | (none) | (none) | same shipment | 200 OK |\n| CANCELLED confirm | findById | (none) | (none) | exception | 409 Conflict + error body |\n| Unknown shipmentId | findById → null | (none) | (none) | exception | 404 Not Found + error body |\n\n**Test strategy:**\n\n1. **Test: creates then confirms a shipment** — Create shipment in CREATED status, call confirm, verify response is 200 OK and shipment status is CONFIRMED. Tests the happy path transition.\n\n2. **Test: confirm on already-confirmed shipment is idempotent** — Create and confirm a shipment, call confirm again, verify 200 OK and shipment unchanged. Tests retry safety for operations.\n\n3. **Test: rejects confirm on a cancelled shipment with conflict error** — Manually place a shipment in CANCELLED status (direct repository write, no endpoint), call confirm, verify 409 Conflict with error code SHIPMENT_INVALID_STATE. Tests the forbidden state transition.\n\n4. **Test: rejects confirm on a nonexistent shipment** — Call confirm with a shipment ID that doesn't exist, verify 404 Not Found with error code SHIPMENT_NOT_FOUND. Tests missing resource handling.\n\n**Code locations and order:**\n1. Edit ApiError.kt to add SHIPMENT_INVALID_STATE\n2. Edit ShipmentController.kt to add confirm method\n3. Edit ShipmentControllerTest.kt to add four test cases\n\n---\n\n<<PHASE:IMPLEMENTATION>>"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":8,"cache_creation_input_tokens":511,"cache_read_input_tokens":17344,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":511},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"31693248-9567-48bf-9976-05b633e8f1e6","uuid":"a72773d1-dc1b-4b36-a87b-a3fa48b60753","timestamp":"2026-09-10T12:58:51.128Z","request_id":"req_011CeuoEx3zFpnn31PeCa8F8"}
